7782f36a","date":"2026-06-04T08:53:05.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(feat) O3-5413: Add bill refunds (#738)","message":"(feat) O3-5413: Add bill refunds (#738)\n\n* feat(refunds): add bill refunds feature\n\n- Cashiers can request refunds on PAID/PARTIALLY_REFUNDED bills; admins approve or reject; cashiers then process approved refunds to COMPLETED\n- Supports bill-level and line-item-scoped refunds with cumulative cap enforcement; at most one active refund per scope at a time\n- Adds admin Refund Requests page, cashier Request Refund modal, and admin Review Bill Refunds modal with receipt rail showing approved and completed refund totals\n- Fixes: REJECTED refunds were incorrectly reducing remainingRefundable; COMPLETED refunds were not deducted from line-item remaining (double-refund risk); bill.refunds?.filter().reduce() crashed when refunds was undefined\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): add pending refunds filter to bills table\n\nAdds REFUND_REQUESTED to BillStatus and a 'Pending refunds' filter option in the bills table to surface bills awaiting refund processing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): address SonarCloud issues in refunds feature\n\n- Extract deeply nested onRefundRequest/onClick callbacks into named functions\n- Replace chained ternaries with if/else block before JSX return\n- Add null guard in handleRequestRefund to remove non-null assertions\n- Use flatMap for type-safe lineItemUuid set construction\n- Remove unnecessary `as RefundStatus` cast (type already narrows correctly)\n- Replace role=\"progressbar\" on div with aria-busy=\"true\"\n- Mark component props interfaces as readonly\n- Replace window with globalThis in test files\n- Remove unused showSnackbar and useOpenmrsFetchAll imports\n- Replace parseFloat with Number.parseFloat\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): remove unnecessary non-null assertion in handleLineItemRefundRequest\n\nAdd early return guard for item.uuid so TypeScript narrows the type,\nmaking the ! assertion redundant and satisfying SonarClou","messageCut":"message cut to 2000 characters","ticketKeys":["O3-5413"],"pullRequests":[738],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"552645377bab4a84cbe905a06bec45c65b01d652","date":"2026-03-03T11:27:44.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(fix) Add quantity > 0 validation to billing form (#648)","message":"(fix) Add quantity > 0 validation to billing form (#648)\n\n* (fix) add quantity > 0 validation to billing form\n\nPrevent submission of bill items with zero or empty quantity.\nExtends `validateSelectedItems` to show an error snackbar and\nreturn false when any item's quantity is falsy or less than 1.\n\n* review changes\n\n* (fix) Remove min={1} from quantity NumberInput\n\nmin={1} on Carbon's NumberInput prevents the invalid state from\nsurfacing when the user clears or enters a value below 1. Removing\nit lets the inline invalid/invalidText validation display correctly.","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[648],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"f5252e6e7d6bfb3306d89c47d03d69dd1d401bf7","date":"2025-11-21T21:18:37.000Z","author":"Raj Prakash","subject":"(feat) O3-5057: Remove bill waiver from left panel (#531)","message":"(feat) O3-5057: Remove bill waiver from left panel (#531)","ticketKeys":["O3-5057"],"pullRequests":[531],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"e6dc0633476bbe9212b5ca78dc49405d7b01f2ba","date":"2025-11-18T12:32:45.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(fix) Add missing translations (#527)","message":"(fix) Add missing translations (#527)\n\n* (fix): Missing translations in invoice component\n\n* Add missing translations\n\n* (fix) Fix invoice number selector in e2e tests after translation update\n\nUpdated the selector to match the translated text \"Invoice #\" and use\ngetByRole('heading') to avoid strict mode violations. Added proper wait\nlogic for element visibility.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[527],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"5a075d677b799b9b62bac10e606afe84e2088d78","date":"2025-11-10T12:05:48.000Z","author":"Dennis Kigen","subject":"(test) Add E2E tests for quantity increment and split payment workflows (#509)","message":"(test) Add E2E tests for quantity increment and split payment workflows (#509)\n\nAdds three comprehensive E2E tests for billing scenarios involving:\n\n- Creating bills with increased service quantities via re-selection\n- Processing payments split across multiple payment methods\n- Combined workflow of quantity increase with split payment\n\nEnhance page object models with helper methods:\n\n- clearBillableServiceCombobox() for resetting service selection\n- verifyGrandTotal() for total amount assertions\n- Enhanced addMultiplePayments() for handling split payment scenarios\n\nTests verify both frontend UI state and backend API responses to ensure data consistency\nacross bill creation, line item status updates, and payment processing workflows.","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[509],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"9c12676f7dd257f47f5ff22f4055fd6e0fd05ee9","date":"2025-10-15T18:55:32.000Z","author":"Dennis Kigen","subject":"(fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations (#437)","message":"(fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations (#437)\n\n* (fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations\n\nVoided (soft-deleted) line items were being included in bill totals,\nstatus calculations, and item lists, causing incorrect amounts and\nmisleading bill statuses.\n\nChanges:\n- Filter voided items in mapBillProperties before all calculations\n- Use calculateTotalAmount helper in bill waiver (includes voided check)\n- Refactor promise chains to async/await with try/catch/finally\n- Improve URL building in useBills with server-side status filtering\n- Add currency formatting for all price displays\n- Translate hardcoded strings in billing checkin form\n- Add accessibility improvements (aria-live on dynamic totals)\n- Remove unused code and imports\n\nTests:\n- Fix edit-bill-item tests broken by currency formatting changes\n- Add form validation test coverage for quantity constraints\n- Verify validation errors appear/clear correctly\n- Ensure submission is blocked with invalid data\n\nImpact: Bills with voided items will now show correct totals and status.\nPreviously, a fully paid bill could incorrectly show as PENDING if it\ncontained voided items.\n\n* Additional fix: register edit bill line item modal using modal system","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[437],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"66a4fb7e2f45735e7b0cf62fb3ebe22c3cdfff89","date":"2025-10-10T20:15:54.000Z","author":"praneeth","subject":"(fix) O3-5058: Remove leading zero from payment amount input (#404)","message":"(fix) O3-5058: Remove leading zero from payment amount input (#404)\n\n* (fix) O3-5058: Remove leading zero from payment amount input \n\nThis PR fixes an issue where the payment amount input field would default to \"0\", forcing users to manually clear it before entering an amount. The input now starts empty and allows proper data entry without the leading zero.\n\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","ticketKeys":["O3-5058"],"pullRequests":[404],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"a19fecc28a9f9b63a3e7513b86efeadec1f0cf77","date":"2025-10-10T19:41:33.000Z","author":"Dennis Kigen","subject":"(fix) Improve billable services management with enhanced validation and UX (#413)","message":"(fix) Improve billable services management with enhanced validation and UX (#413)\n\nMakes refactors to the billable services management system with improved form\nvalidation, TypeScript typing, and critical bug fixes.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add comprehensive Zod validation for billable services forms\n- Fix critical row ID bug in edit bill item modal that prevented editing\n- Add alphabetical sorting of payment modes and service types\n- Make service name readonly when editing a billable service (to maintain data integrity for existing transactions)\n- Improve form validation with clear, translated error messages\n- Update TypeScript types for better type safety\n- Fix trimming in the concept search functionality so empty strings are not treated as search terms\n- Improve button hierarchy and UI consistency\n\nTest updates:\n- Fix billing-checkin-form tests with proper mocks\n- Update test assertions to match the new validation schema","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[413],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"8dff11df04d70bb3876b76c3a6bc7f98c49fe153","date":"2025-10-09T17:43:29.000Z","author":"Dennis Kigen","subject":"(feat) Standardize modal component naming and improve modal management (#408)","message":"(feat) Standardize modal component naming and improve modal management (#408)\n\n* (feat) Standardize modal component naming and improve modal management\n\nThis PR modernizes the billing app's architecture by migrating modal components from using Carbon components directly to using the standard modal system.\nThis change improves maintainability and future-proofs the app's architecture.\n\n- Rename modal files from `*.component.tsx` to `*.modal.tsx` for consistency\n- Migrate modals to use `showModal()` API instead of local state management\n- Add dedicated modal components for cash points and payment modes\n- Fix form submission in modals by ensuring buttons are within form