ture (#508)","message":"(test) O3-5164: Add billing dashboard workflow test and refactor test structure (#508)\n\n* (test) O3-5164: Add billing dashboard workflow test and refactor test structure\n\nAdds comprehensive E2E test suite for the billing dashboard workflow covering the following scenarios:\n\n- Navigation to billing dashboard\n- Display of pending bills\n- Payment processing\n- Status updates (bills transitioning from PENDING to PAID)\n- Bill movement between pending and paid filters in the Bill List table\n\nIt also refactors the test structure to be more modular and easier to maintain. Specifically, this involves:\n\n- Splitting billing tests into separate files by workflow:\n  * billing-patient-chart.spec.ts: Patient Chart workflow\n  * billing-dashboard.spec.ts: Billing Dashboard workflow\n- Replacing try-finally cleanup with canonical test.afterEach hooks\n- Adding error handling in cleanup to prevent failures from blocking other cleanup\n\nAlso adds a new BillingDashboardPage page object for handling the billing dashboard UI interactions.\n\n* Fixup","ticketKeys":["O3-5164"],"pullRequests":[508],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"b7162ecff5e9cf2409d55b944244ec0de244d3e7","date":"2025-10-22T22:51:39.000Z","author":"abertnamanya","subject":"(feat) O3-5141: Add ability to edit payment methods (#452)","message":"(feat) O3-5141: Add ability to edit payment methods (#452)\n\n* Add ability to edit payment methods\n\n* minor fixes\n\n* Allow cash point create and update with two different functions\n\n* Useful refactorings\n\n- Rename `add-payment-mode.modal.tsx` to `payment-mode-form.modal.tsx` to reflect dual add/edit purpose\n- Add proper TypeScript types (PaymentMode interface) exported from resource file\n- Fix test mock to use jest.fn() instead of null for mutate function\n- Implement proper cache invalidation using useSWRConfig for add/edit/delete operations\n- Add UUID validation with optional chaining in edit mode\n- Restore errorFetchingPaymentModes translation key for consistency\n- Remove callback prop drilling in favor of direct cache invalidation\n- Consolidate duplicate PaymentMode interface definitions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","ticketKeys":["O3-5141"],"pullRequests":[452],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"24096120c5407e95a9433427251f61d629df6a91","date":"2025-10-16T21:12:22.000Z","author":"praneeth","subject":"(fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service (#428)","message":"(fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service (#428)\n\n* (fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service\n\n* updated translation for delete payment mode\n\n* updated\n\n* fixup\n\n* fix price input\n\n* Fixup\n\n1. Fix Concept UUID Capture - Changes concept type from ConceptSearchResult to { uuid: string; display: string }\n2. Fix Concept Initialization - When editing an existing service, properly extracts only `uuid` and `display` from `serviceToEdit.concept`\n3. Fix Translation Interpolation - Changes `{searchTerm}` → `{{searchTerm}}` (correct i18next syntax)\n4. Loader Styling Update - Updates CSS for the loader component\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","ticketKeys":["O3-5116"],"pullRequests":[428],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"9c12676f7dd257f47f5ff22f4055fd6e0fd05ee9","date":"2025-10-15T18:55:32.000Z","author":"Dennis Kigen","subject":"(fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations (#437)","message":"(fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations (#437)\n\n* (fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations\n\nVoided (soft-deleted) line items were being included in bill totals,\nstatus calculations, and item lists, causing incorrect amounts and\nmisleading bill statuses.\n\nChanges:\n- Filter voided items in mapBillProperties before all calculations\n- Use calculateTotalAmount helper in bill waiver (includes voided check)\n- Refactor promise chains to async/await with try/catch/finally\n- Improve URL building in useBills with server-side status filtering\n- Add currency formatting for all price displays\n- Translate hardcoded strings in billing checkin form\n- Add accessibility improvements (aria-live on dynamic totals)\n- Remove unused code and imports\n\nTests:\n- Fix edit-bill-item tests broken by currency formatting changes\n- Add form validation test coverage for quantity constraints\n- Verify validation errors appear/clear correctly\n- Ensure submission is blocked with invalid data\n\nImpact: Bills with voided items will now show correct totals and status.\nPreviously, a fully paid bill could incorrectly show as PENDING if it\ncontained voided items.\n\n* Additional fix: register edit bill line item modal using modal system","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[437],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"cf4c767693faa707a9b1a2bf51b3e70ab936d37f","date":"2025-08-29T19:40:27.000Z","author":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","subject":"(chore) Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies (#350)","message":"(chore) Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies (#350)\n\n* Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies\n\n* Delete .idea files","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[350],"linksSource":"message, unverified"}],"filters":{"repos":["github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-billing"],"revisions":["HEAD"],"messageTerms":["pending bill","delete","abandon","visit bill","unpaid"],"after":"2025-01-01","count":30},"coverageGaps":[],"truncated":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e14f54fe-da9b-4513-b050-bb3e25b7f656","uuid":"54104450-01e3-4b59-a8ed-2751f90e4c20","timestamp":"2026-10-31T16:12:50.989Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"bfc75902616d01ad503df362e8c1b84cef60b9dc","date":"2026-06-17T13:19:52.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(feat) O3-5743: Show an empty state with a Finalize bill action on pending bills (#769)","message":"(feat) O3-5743: Show an empty state with a Finalize bill action on pending bills (#769)","ticketKeys":["O3-5743"],"pullRequests":[769],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"e8126b39dc10bcdc719250b004afe86f7782f36a","date":"2026-06-04T08:53:05.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(feat) O3-5413: Add bill refunds (#738)","message":"(feat) O3-5413: Add bill refunds (#738)\n\n* feat(refunds): add bill refunds feature\n\n- Cashiers can request refunds on PAID/PARTIALLY_REFUNDED bills; admins approve or reject; cashiers then process approved refunds to COMPLETED\n- Supports bill-level and line-item-scoped refunds with cumulative cap enforcement; at most one active refund per scope at a time\n- Adds admin Refund Requests page, cashier Request Refund modal, and admin Review Bill Refunds modal with receipt rail showing approved and completed refund totals\n- Fixes: REJECTED refunds were incorrectly reducing remainingRefundable; COMPLETED refunds were not deducted from line-item remaining (double-refund risk); bill.refunds?.filter().reduce() crashed when refunds was undefined\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): add pending refunds filter to bills table\n\nAdds REFUND_REQUESTED to BillStatus and a 'Pending refunds' filter option in the bills table to surface bills awaiting refund processing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): address SonarCloud issues in refunds feature\n\n- Extract deeply nested onRefundRequest/onClick callbacks into named functions\n- Replace chained ternaries with if/else block before JSX return\n- Add null guard in handleRequestRefund to remove non-null assertions\n- Use flatMap for type-safe lineItemUuid set construction\n- Remove unnecessary `as RefundStatus` cast (type already narrows correctly)\n- Replace role=\"progressbar\" on div with aria-busy=\"true\"\n- Mark component props interfaces as readonly\n- Replace window with globalThis in test files\n- Remove unused showSnackbar and useOpenmrsFetchAll imports\n- Replace parseFloat with Number.parseFloat\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): remove unnecessary non-null assertion in handleLineItemRefundRequest\n\nAdd early return guard for item.uuid so TypeScript narrows the type,\nmaking the ! assertion redundant and satisfying SonarClou","messageCut":"message cut to 2000 characters","ticketKeys":["O3-5413"],"pullRequests":[738],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"4aa8e4c993d5fe06147c9561c949a6da36aea47e","date":"2026-06-02T12:06:06.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(feat) O3-5421: Add visit-bills panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary (#741)","message":"(feat) O3-5421: Add visit-bills panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary (#741)\n\n* feat: add visit-bills-panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address SonarCloud issues in visit-bills-panel\n\n- Use stable header.key instead of array index in DataTable header keys\n- Replace window with globalThis in test setup for env-agnostic access\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: resolve i18next-parser duplicate key warnings\n\n- Use `loadingDescription` for aria-label \"Loading\" (bills-table, discount-requests)\n  instead of reusing `loading` with a different default value\n- Introduce `invoiceNo` key for abbreviated \"Invoice #\" (discount-requests,\n  printable-invoice-header) so `invoiceNumber` stays consistently \"Invoice number\"\n- Normalise `totalAmount` default to sentence-case \"Total amount\" in printable invoice\n- Introduce `deleteBillFailedTryAgain` key for the bill-deletion error message,\n  separate from the existing line-item-specific `deleteFailedTryAgain`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): update invoiceNumberLabel locator to match renamed translation\n\nThe `invoiceNumber` key in translations/en.json was changed from \"Invoice #\"\nto \"Invoice number\" in 99a36cc. Update the e2e locator to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Bump billing backend dependency and fix stale invoiceNumber translations\n\n- Raise backendDependencies billing version to >=2.3.0-0 to include SNAPSHOT builds\n- Update invoiceNumber label to \"Invoice number\" across all locale files to align with the invoiceNo/invoiceNumber key split\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add viewOnly regression tests for InvoiceTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use getCoreTranslation for loading aria-label in BillsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@a","messageCut":"message cut to 2000 characters","ticketKeys":["O3-5421"],"pullRequests":[741],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"e5b80768f3166c82b2db7c710e166adf01ce3f70","date":"2026-05-25T19:36:06.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(fix) O3-5708: Keep discount review modal open after approve/reject/delete actions (#744)","message":"(fix) O3-5708: Keep discount review modal open after approve/reject/delete actions (#744)","ticketKeys":["O3-5708"],"pullRequests":[744],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-billing","hash":"59204a940f65cf2f6741556fc43ed0e1d375c55a","date":"2026-05-21T09:02:44.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"Delete bill discounts and refunds when purging bill (#174)","message":"Delete bill discounts and refunds when purging bill (#174)\n\n* (chore) Delete bill discounts and refunds when purging bill\n\n* (fix) Fix bill refund test UUIDs and correct Liquibase changeset ordering\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply suggestion from @wikumChamith\n\nCo-authored-by: Wikum Weerakutti <wikum@linuxdeveloper.space>\n\n* (fix) Use valid hex UUIDs for bill refund test fixtures\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Sync test assertions with corrected refund fixture UUIDs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Wikum Weerakutti <wikum@linuxdeveloper.space>","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[174],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad","date":"2026-05-18T16:52:25.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature (#732)","message":"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature (#732)\n\n* (feat) Add bill discounts feature\n\nReplaces bill waivers with a structured discounts workflow:\n- Per-line-item discount requests via request-discount modal\n- Discounts table on invoice and printable invoice\n- Admin dashboard for reviewing pending discount requests\n- Review-bill-discounts modal with line items, payments, totals,\n  and receipt rail\n- Discount entry points wired into invoice page and left-panel\n- Privilege-aware visibility (useHasPrivilege, feature flag hook)\n- Server-sourced bill totals via mapBillProperties\n- BillDiscount type contract and discount resource hooks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add e2e tests for bill discounts workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Update e2e page objects for new invoice layout\n\n* (test) Purge bill discounts before bill in e2e cleanup\n\n* (test) Skip bill discount e2e pending backend purge support\n\nBackend BillDiscountResource.purge throws UnsupportedOperationException, so\nthe discount workflow spec leaks bills and patients between runs. Skip it and\ncomment out the discount-cleanup helper until backend purge support lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Address PR review comments on bill discounts\n\n- Differentiate Delete button styling from Reject (kind=\"danger\")\n- Use custom REST representation instead of v=full for discount requests\n- Drop redundant optional chaining on bill in payments breakdown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use default rep, memoize modal callbacks, memoize children\n\n- Revert custom REST representation to `default` (backend doesn't\n  serialize nested discount status under custom projections)\n- Wrap modal handlers in useCallback and children in React.memo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Address more PR review c","messageCut":"message cut to 2000 characters","ticketKeys":["O3-5417"],"pullRequests":[732],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"db22701b986ae73bc876df2327fa0f82a7fd3ed5","date":"2026-04-21T20:38:55.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(feat) Add delete action for pending bills (#717)","message":"(feat) Add delete action for pending bills (#717)","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[717],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"c1139db6f410c576cfcdec7d226edc58ef7728ee","date":"2026-02-13T18:44:37.000Z","author":"Dennis Kigen","subject":"(fix) Improve delete line item confirmation modal (#629)","message":"(fix) Improve delete line item confirmation modal (#629)\n\nShow the item name in the confirmation message and add a 255-character\nlimit to the deletion reason textarea to align with the backend's\nvarchar(255) constraint.","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[629],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","hash":"6e3d447cbfade14f3ec4b73d1697daf8f203bf79","date":"2026-02-13T10:47:05.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(fix) Delete line items from a bill (#617)","message":"(fix) Delete line items from a bill (#617)\n\nThe billing tables had several inconsistencies: the \"Visit time\" column\nwas misleadingly named (it's actually `dateCreated`), there was no\nreceipt/invoice number column for navigating to invoices, the patient\nname was a link to the invoice page (unintuitive), and the billed items\ndisplay had a trailing \"&\" when a line item lacked a name.\n\n- Rename \"Visit time\" to \"Bill date\" across all billing tables\n- Add \"Invoice number\" column linking to the invoice page in the bill\n  list, bill history, and patient bills tables\n- Remove clickable link from patient name in the bill list table\n- Rename \"Bill code\" to \"Invoice number\" in the invoice line items table\n- Fix trailing \"&\" in billed items by replacing reduce with\n  map/filter/join\n- Update unit tests and e2e tests to reflect the new column structure","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[617],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-billing","hash":"0500a8c4f7795e843b0be9c9f07a33c337fa8e2b","date":"2026-02-13T08:20:22.000Z","author":"Nethmi Rodrigo","subject":"(fix) Delete bill line items from a bill (#106)","message":"(fix) Delete bill line items from a bill (#106)","ticketKeys":[],"pullRequests":[106],"linksSource":"message, unverified"},{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-billing","hash":"3e6ffc12e992cb78151971cf5e6e5da96a85eabd","date":"2026-02-07T04:54:03.000Z","author":"Wikum Weerakutti","subject":"Resolve Declaration Redundancies (#105)","message":"Resolve Declaration Redundancies (#105)\n\n* Resolve Declaration Redundancies\n\n  -